'''Orthos''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Orthos
|image = E 348.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
A very weak enemy that mostly just serves as meatshields for stronger enemies like [[Todomeki (Enemy)|Todomeki]].

